#: main.cpp:36
msgid "Install, list, remove Plasma packages"
msgstr "Pakêtên Plasmayê sazbike, lîste bike, rake"

#: main.cpp:47
msgid "Listing is not yet implemented."
msgstr ""

#: main.cpp:52
msgid "Plasma Package Manager"
msgstr "Gerînendeyê Pakêtên Plasmayê"

#: main.cpp:54
msgid "(C) 2008, Aaron Seigo"
msgstr "(C) 2008, Aaron Seigo"

#: main.cpp:55
msgid "Aaron Seigo"
msgstr "Aaron Seigo"

#: main.cpp:56
msgid "Original author"
msgstr "Nivîskarê yekemîn"

#: main.cpp:65
msgid "For install or remove, operates on packages installed for all users."
msgstr ""
"Ji bo sazkirin û rakirinê, ji bo hemû bikarhêneran li ser pakêtên sazbûyî "
"dixebite."

#: main.cpp:68
msgid ""
"The type of package, e.g. theme, wallpaper, plasmoid, DataEngine, Runner, "
"etc."
msgstr ""
"Cureyê pakêtê, her wekî, dirb, rûerd, plasmoid, MotoraDaneyan, Meşva, hwd."

#: main.cpp:72
msgid "Install the package at <path>"
msgstr "Pakêtê di <path> de saz bike"

#: main.cpp:74
msgid "List installed packages"
msgstr "Pakêtên sazbûyî lîste bike"

#: main.cpp:76
msgid "Remove the package named <name>"
msgstr "Pakêta bi navê <name> rake"

#: main.cpp:78
msgid ""
"Absolute path to the package root. If not supplied, then the standard data "
"directories for this KDE session will be searched instead."
msgstr ""
"Riya roota a pakêtê a tam. Heke neyê zanîn, dê ji dêvla wê vepelrêçên "
"agahiyên standard ên ji bo vê danişîna KDE'yê bê geriyan."

#: main.cpp:97
